  "description": "Sektori is an intense, fast paced twin-stick shooter infused with hard hitting techno music. Choose your upgrades carefully and create powerful builds to take on the relentless enemies and epic bosses on a constantly evolving battlefield. Sektori is a game that requires your complete focus, a game where the high-adrenaline visuals, music, and gameplay come together to transport you into another state of consciousness.\n\nSimple, pure gameplay. Quick runs. Lots of challenge and replayability.\n\nFEATURES\n\n- A five world campaign mode with dynamically changing levels and tons of enemy variation - including epic evolving bosses\n- Alternate ships and configurable upgrade decks to mold your run with\n- Three difficulty modes suited for all players, including a \"Revolution\" campaign mode for maximal challenge\n- Six alternate game modes, like Classic, Gates and Assault\n- Varied selection of challenges and medals to reach for\n",
